<meta property="og:title" content="Pesto Al Cavolo Nero - Tuscan Kale Pesto">
<meta property="og:description" content="Cavolo nero or Tuscan kale is a staple in Tuscan cuisine and you will find it in many of their regional dishes. One of my favourite way to cook with it is making a delicious, seasonal, vibrant pesto!...">
